<XMLDocContent PageName="cobalt.graphics.IFrameBufferOutput.HasCapturedOutput" Title="HasCapturedOutput method" xmlns="http://www.cobaltrenderer.com/schema/XMLDocSchema.xsd">
  <Paragraph>
    <PageRef PageName="cobalt.graphics.Welcome">Home</PageRef> ->
    <PageRef PageName="cobalt.graphics.IFrameBufferOutput">IFrameBufferOutput</PageRef> ->
    HasCapturedOutput
  </Paragraph>
  <Section Title="Description">
    <Paragraph>
      The <TypeRef>HasCapturedOutput</TypeRef> method returns true when a capture operation has completed. This remains true for a successful capture with image dimensions of (0, 0).
    </Paragraph>
  </Section>
  <Section Title="Usage">
    <Code Language="C++"><![CDATA[bool HasCapturedOutput() const;]]></Code>
    <SubSection Title="Return value">
      <ReturnValue Type="bool">
        True if an output capture has completed, including an empty capture, false otherwise.
      </ReturnValue>
    </SubSection>
  </Section>
  <Section Title="See also">
    <PageRefList>
      <PageRefListEntry PageName="cobalt.graphics.IFrameBufferOutput">IFrameBufferOutput</PageRefListEntry>
    </PageRefList>
  </Section>
</XMLDocContent>
